WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.137
♪♪

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.538
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.774
President Biden was set
to discuss

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.608
his infrastructure
proposal today

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:11.211
with the top
Republican negotiator,

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.946
who I think is Joe Manchin?

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:16.649
In an op-ed yesterday,
Democratic Senator Joe Manchin

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.218
announced that he
would be voting

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.753
against a new voting rights bill

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:23.422
and reiterated his support
for the filibuster.

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:25.057
So, when I say he's Democratic,

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:27.627
that's just like
the party he's in.

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.129
Wyoming Congresswoman Liz Cheney
said, in a new interview,

00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:32.465
that former President Trump's
incitement

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.667
of the January attack
on the Capitol is

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:38.171
"the most dangerous thing
a president has done."

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.273
Previously, it was go to a play.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:41.907
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:44.544
So, I'm glad
Scollins didn't change

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.546
[ Laughter ]
after a week off.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.948
And he spent the whole week
in sensitivity training.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.683
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.952
Former President Trump's
daughter-in-law Lara Trump

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.954
announced, over the weekend,
that she will not run

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.622
for a Senate seat
in North Carolina,

00:00:56.622 --> 00:00:59.959
due to her young children,
because she's seen firsthand

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.527
what happens when you neglect

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.329
Trump children.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:06.432
Former President Trump's blog
shut down permanently last week.

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.901
Oh, come on, you're not supposed
to shut down blogs.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.470
You're supposed
to slowly stop posting,

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.172
'til you forget you have one.

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:14.607
Then, a year later,
you do one of those,

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.543
"Hey, guys, sorry I haven't
updated in a while" posts,

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:18.578
even though literally
no one's been asking

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.313
and no one could care less.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.481
A spokesperson for British
Prime Minister Boris Johnson

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:24.951
recently announced
that he married his fiancée

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:26.619
in a small, private ceremony.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.120
Just what the world needed --

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:29.855
another, less effective,

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:32.225
Johnson &amp; Johnson.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:35.595
Today was former Vice President
Mike Pence's 62nd birthday,

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:39.165
despite Donald Trump's
best efforts.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.100
Former Vice President
Mike Punce recent--

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.168
"Punce."

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.371
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:46.839
I got it right
the previous joke.

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:49.509
-Yeah, yeah, you had it.
-So like I know what it is.

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.911
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.346
You guys remember this punce?
["putz"]

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:55.248
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:57.917
Former Vice President Mike Pence
recently spoke

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.086
at a Lincoln-Reagan Dinner
in New Hampshire

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.787
about the January attack
on the Capitol.

00:02:01.787 --> 00:02:02.956
He didn't intend to,

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.825
but that's just
how flashbacks work.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:09.395
Officials in Los Angeles County
are reportedly set to vote soon

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.664
on a law that prohibits
feeding peacocks

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:15.000
and make it punishable
by up to a $1,000 fine

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.636
or six months in jail.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.205
Incidentally, "feeding the
peacock" is also what I call

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.140
making 200 shows a year.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:22.842
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:24.944
Oh, and she has an appetite!

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.346
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:29.548
A 30-year-old woman in Texas
was arrested

00:02:29.548 --> 00:02:31.083
for trespassing recently,

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:33.653
after she allegedly posed
as her 13-year-old daughter

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.154
and spent the day at her school.

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:36.489
Damn, lady, why didn't you just

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.923
enjoy high school
when you were there?

00:02:37.923 --> 00:02:39.258
Wait, oh, so she's 30.

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:40.259
Her daughter's 13.

00:02:40.259 --> 00:02:41.727
Oh, okay.
Okay, I see.

00:02:41.727 --> 00:02:43.095
Enjoy yourself.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:46.299
And, finally, Amazon
CEO Jeff Bezos announced today,

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:48.901
in an Instagram post,
that he and his brother will be

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:50.503
on the first crew space flight

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:53.306
of his private rocket company
later this year.

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:55.175
If he wants to see space
so badly,

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.643
he should just open one
of his packages.

00:02:57.643 --> 00:02:58.811
♪♪

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.179
President Biden leaves tomorrow

00:03:00.179 --> 00:03:02.515
on his first foreign trip
since taking office

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:05.584
and, like all 78-year-old men,
that means he's already

00:03:05.584 --> 00:03:07.453
at the airport.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:10.055
Vice President Kamala Harris
addressed potential migrants

00:03:10.055 --> 00:03:12.725
in Guatemala during a news
conference yesterday and said,

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.193
"Do not come.

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:15.495
Do not come."

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:17.530
Wow, it's like she
read directly

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.697
from the Statue of Liberty.

00:03:18.697 --> 00:03:21.167
Wait. I swear to God
it used to be there.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:23.001
[ Laughter ]
New York Mayor Bill de Blasio

00:03:23.001 --> 00:03:25.304
announced he's planning
a concert in Central Park

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:28.141
later this summer to celebrate
the reopening of the city

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:30.710
after the pandemic and this,

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:34.213
this is the guy you want
planning your concerts.

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:37.182
It's going to be that band
from the Viagra commercial,

00:03:37.182 --> 00:03:39.418
[ Laughter ]
then, a Jimmy Buffett cover band

00:03:39.418 --> 00:03:41.120
called Jimmy Buffet.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.222
Then, at 8:00 pm,
everybody, out of the park

00:03:43.222 --> 00:03:44.556
or the cops move in!

00:03:44.556 --> 00:03:47.326
[ Laughter ]
CNN yesterday obtained the audio

00:03:47.326 --> 00:03:49.294
of a 2019 phone call made

00:03:49.294 --> 00:03:52.098
by former President Trump's
attorney Rudy Giuliani,

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:55.201
in which Giuliani pressured
a Ukrainian official

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:58.070
to announce an investigation
into possible corruption

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.506
by then-presidential candidate
Joe Biden, but,

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:03.342
it's actually not a slam dunk
for prosecutors.

00:04:03.342 --> 00:04:04.610
See if you can tell why.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:07.847
-I kind of think that this
could be a good thing

00:04:07.847 --> 00:04:11.384
for having a much --
a much better relationship,

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:12.952
where we really
understand each other.

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:14.387
[ Beep ]
-Thank you for calling

00:04:14.387 --> 00:04:16.155
the Long Island Aquarium.
-See? That's the problem.

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:18.424
-Your call is very
important to us.

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:20.759
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.759 --> 00:04:23.362
-Amazon's website was
temporarily down this morning,

00:04:23.362 --> 00:04:26.432
due to an issue with their cloud
computing services provider,

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:27.934
but don't worry,
I'm sure that flight

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.268
into outer space next month

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:30.769
will go great.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.769 --> 00:04:33.305
Republican Representative
Marjorie Taylor Greene on Friday

00:04:33.305 --> 00:04:35.708
sent a letter to President Biden
that demanded he launch

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:38.611
an investigation
into Dr. Anthony Fauci

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:41.280
and provide answers
by June 31st,

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.982
a date that does not exist.

00:04:43.982 --> 00:04:45.651
Which is surprising,
considering the last thing

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:49.188
I would've expected her to do
is extend Pride Month.

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:52.224
Former President Trump is set
to go on a tour

00:04:52.224 --> 00:04:55.828
with former Fox News host
Bill O'Reilly later this year.

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:59.465
Oh, better lock up
your daughters.

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:01.467
Seriously, though,
it's probably best if you do.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.903
You know, just 'til they're
out of town.

00:05:03.903 --> 00:05:05.871
The owner of a pub in England
recently discovered

00:05:05.871 --> 00:05:09.308
a time capsule from the 1970s
hidden in the walls of the bar.

00:05:09.308 --> 00:05:10.609
Locals are fascinated

00:05:10.609 --> 00:05:14.113
because they've never seen
anything that new.

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:17.483
Nathan's Famous yesterday
began offering meatless hot dogs

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:19.451
and, for what it's worth,
it took Joey Chestnut

00:05:19.451 --> 00:05:21.454
50 dogs before he noticed.

00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:22.722
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:25.391
So, pretty good.

00:05:25.391 --> 00:05:28.194
The world's largest
Harry Potter flagship store

00:05:28.194 --> 00:05:29.795
recently opened in New York,

00:05:29.795 --> 00:05:33.065
which displays over 1,000 props
from the movie series,

00:05:33.065 --> 00:05:35.133
or -- and hear me out --

00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:36.469
it's a hardware store.

00:05:36.469 --> 00:05:39.539
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.539 --> 00:05:42.608
Finally, in a new interview,
sexual health expert Dr. Ruth

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:45.244
said that 90-year-olds
should still have sex,

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:46.812
if they have a good partner,
but added,

00:05:46.812 --> 00:05:49.081
"If you don't have a partner,

00:05:49.081 --> 00:05:51.650
they should satisfy themselves,"
so, now,

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:53.719
if you hear Grandpa
had a stroke,

00:05:53.719 --> 00:05:55.087
maybe it's good news.

00:05:55.087 --> 00:05:57.456
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.456 --> 00:06:00.960
You know, I'm not going to name
the guy who wrote that,

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.563
but, if you watch this show,
you know who it is.

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:05.498
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:06.799
Tank top!

00:06:06.799 --> 00:06:07.867
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:10.069
Roots for the
New England Patriots.

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:13.339
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.339 --> 00:06:15.641
Favorite movie character is
Casey Affleck

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:18.410
from "Good Will Hunting."
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.578
♪♪

00:06:19.578 --> 00:06:20.813
President Biden yesterday

00:06:20.813 --> 00:06:22.848
ended infrastructure
negotiations

00:06:22.848 --> 00:06:25.685
with Republican
Senator Shelley Moore Capito

00:06:25.685 --> 00:06:28.855
and opened talks with another
group of GOP lawmakers,

00:06:28.855 --> 00:06:30.656
led by Senator Bill Cassidy.

00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:33.458
Dude, you can keep searching,
but you're not going to find

00:06:33.458 --> 00:06:35.794
a reasonable group
of GOP senators.

00:06:35.794 --> 00:06:37.963
You're like a woman who says,
"Maybe if I go

00:06:37.963 --> 00:06:40.132
to a different
Buffalo Wild Wings,

00:06:40.132 --> 00:06:41.567
I'll find a husband."

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:43.302
[ Laughter ]
During an interview this week

00:06:43.302 --> 00:06:45.504
with NBC news anchor
Lester Holt,

00:06:45.504 --> 00:06:47.640
Vice President Kamala Harris
defended

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.642
the migrant situation
at the southern "bordah" --

00:06:49.642 --> 00:06:51.610
border -- excuse me --
and said,

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:53.713
"There's not going to be
a quick fix."

00:06:53.713 --> 00:06:56.482
I don't know, it seemed like
you had one the other day.

00:06:56.482 --> 00:06:59.485
-Do not come.

00:06:59.485 --> 00:07:00.953
Do not come.

00:07:00.953 --> 00:07:02.287
-According to a recent poll,

00:07:02.287 --> 00:07:05.157
Brooklyn Borough President
Eric Adams leads the field

00:07:05.157 --> 00:07:07.360
in the New York
mayoral Democratic primary,

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.962
ahead of former presidential
hopeful Andrew Yang.

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:12.531
Said Yang, "What the hell
is Brooklyn?"

00:07:12.531 --> 00:07:13.832
[ Laughter ]

00:07:13.832 --> 00:07:17.236
Right-wing cable channel Newsmax
reportedly turned down

00:07:17.236 --> 00:07:19.672
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz
earlier this year,

00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:21.673
after he approached them
about a job.

00:07:21.673 --> 00:07:24.509
But if you knew what kind of job
he was asking for,

00:07:24.509 --> 00:07:25.778
you'd turn him down, too.

00:07:25.778 --> 00:07:26.846
[ Laughter ]

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:28.181
Federal prosecutors recently

00:07:28.181 --> 00:07:29.615
arrested a Pennsylvania man

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:32.018
who allegedly posed
as former President Trump

00:07:32.018 --> 00:07:34.654
to collect funds for a fake
reelection organization,

00:07:34.654 --> 00:07:37.857
but instead used the money
for personal expenses.

00:07:37.857 --> 00:07:41.294
What did they charge him with,
plagiarism?

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:42.862
[ Laughter ]
Starbucks announced yesterday

00:07:42.862 --> 00:07:45.698
it's reintroducing
its 10-cent discount

00:07:45.698 --> 00:07:48.834
for customers who bring
personal reusable cups.

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:51.670
Meanwhile, Dunkin' customers
can save a buck

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.472
if they just
hold out their hands.

00:07:53.472 --> 00:07:55.241
[ Laughter ]

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:57.610
That's our Dunkin' customer?

00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:59.177
[ Laughter ]

00:07:59.177 --> 00:08:02.315
Feel like that fights the joke.

00:08:02.315 --> 00:08:04.183
[ Laughter ]

00:08:04.183 --> 00:08:06.118
"Off to my business meeting!"

00:08:06.118 --> 00:08:07.419
[ Laughter ]

00:08:07.419 --> 00:08:09.888
Ford yesterday unveiled

00:08:09.888 --> 00:08:12.858
its new hybrid engine
compact pickup truck.

00:08:12.858 --> 00:08:14.793
So if you love
driving a pickup,

00:08:14.793 --> 00:08:16.361
but you care
about the environment,

00:08:16.361 --> 00:08:19.065
I kind of just want
to learn more about you.

00:08:19.065 --> 00:08:20.066
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:21.400
And finally, a travel agency

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.668
has announced plans to offer

00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:24.570
a "Friends"-themed cruise
next year.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.605
And nothing says
"I miss the '90s"

00:08:26.605 --> 00:08:28.607
more than still using
a travel agent.

00:08:28.607 --> 00:08:29.842
♪♪

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:31.376
While preparing to board

00:08:31.376 --> 00:08:33.812
Air Force One yesterday
on his first foreign trip

00:08:33.812 --> 00:08:36.615
since taking office,
President Biden was hit

00:08:36.615 --> 00:08:38.483
in the neck by a flying cicada.

00:08:38.483 --> 00:08:41.854
And get this, Biden still thinks
they can find common ground.

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:44.456
[ As Biden ]
Come on, man,
let's work together.

00:08:44.456 --> 00:08:46.525
President Biden addressed
a group of U.S. troops

00:08:46.525 --> 00:08:48.694
serving abroad
in the UK yesterday

00:08:48.694 --> 00:08:51.330
and promised that he wouldn't
hold back in his meeting

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.866
next week with Russian
President Vladimir Putin.

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:56.568
So look out, Vladimir,
you're about to get called

00:08:56.568 --> 00:08:59.105
Buster Brown.

00:08:59.105 --> 00:09:02.174
Before leaving yesterday
for the UK, President Biden said

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:04.810
that the trip is all about
strengthening the alliance

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.545
with Europe.
That's never a good sign.

00:09:06.545 --> 00:09:09.648
Anytime a couple goes on a trip
to strengthen their alliance,

00:09:09.648 --> 00:09:12.551
you know they're about two weeks
away from a divorce.

00:09:12.551 --> 00:09:14.387
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
met today

00:09:14.387 --> 00:09:17.022
with British Prime Minister
Boris Johnson's wife, Carrie,

00:09:17.022 --> 00:09:18.557
over tea.
Oh, man.

00:09:18.557 --> 00:09:21.160
It's like those moms in the park
who only hang out

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.261
'cause their kids are friends.

00:09:22.261 --> 00:09:24.096
"Oh, Joe -- Joe fell down.

00:09:24.096 --> 00:09:25.864
Joe, get up.
You're fine, honey."

00:09:25.864 --> 00:09:27.733
[ British Accent ] Boris.
Boris, what did you just put

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:29.468
in your mouth?
Spit it out, Boris.

00:09:29.468 --> 00:09:31.436
After President Biden this week

00:09:31.436 --> 00:09:35.040
told her he would end their
infrastructure negotiations,

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.176
Republican
Senator Shelley Moore Capito

00:09:37.176 --> 00:09:38.811
said in an interview yesterday

00:09:38.811 --> 00:09:41.080
that she was disappointed
in Biden's decision.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:43.015
Said progressives,
"Disappointed in Biden?

00:09:43.015 --> 00:09:45.217
Finally, some common ground."

00:09:45.217 --> 00:09:49.488
Vice President Kamala Harris
invited every female senator

00:09:49.488 --> 00:09:51.323
to a dinner next week
at her residence,

00:09:51.323 --> 00:09:54.160
while Kyrsten Sinema
invited them to...

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.729
adult Quidditch?

00:09:56.729 --> 00:10:00.633
And a midnight screening
of "Rocky Horror"?

00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:02.601
France is reportedly
sending the U.S.

00:10:02.601 --> 00:10:05.871
a replica statue of --
a replica Statue of Liberty,

00:10:05.871 --> 00:10:08.306
excuse me,
nicknamed "The Little Sister,"

00:10:08.306 --> 00:10:11.810
and it'll be the only foreigner
we let in this year.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.979
The final episode
of the reality show

00:10:13.979 --> 00:10:16.148
"Keeping Up with the
Kardashians" aired tonight

00:10:16.148 --> 00:10:18.016
and, if you've never seen
the show before,

00:10:18.016 --> 00:10:19.684
trust me, you've kept up.

00:10:19.684 --> 00:10:21.186
They're sisters
and they're rich.

00:10:21.186 --> 00:10:23.088
Got it.

00:10:23.088 --> 00:10:24.990
My wife loves that show.
I've never seen an episode.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:29.495
I only hear it while she's
watching it on her phone

00:10:29.495 --> 00:10:32.464
and I feel like I've heard this
a hundred times.

00:10:32.464 --> 00:10:35.534
[ Crying ] "It is just really
hard having sisters."

00:10:39.571 --> 00:10:41.206
And finally,
Mattel announced today

00:10:41.206 --> 00:10:43.009
that it will launch a new
line of Barbies

00:10:43.009 --> 00:10:45.043
that are made
from recycled plastic,

00:10:45.043 --> 00:10:46.478
called Barbie Loves the Ocean.

00:10:46.478 --> 00:10:47.880
Which a great idea.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:51.784
I just wish they'd recycled it
a little bit more.

00:10:51.784 --> 00:10:55.388 line:0%
♪♪

00:10:55.388 --> 00:10:57.089 line:0%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

